  "content": "![在此替换为描述](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f24fa155b3eb8c09434e26d0a65d5609561e0623.png)\n#\n<center>\n \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Mtcd\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/211a96955ba8beeafaf0140682832e34f73fe2ff.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Modrinth页面\"/>\n</a>\n   \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/VkKkKwyDKH\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e1f34d39f5cb7ef6cc84d0a871463ce7201a2644.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Discord链接\"/>\n</a>\n   \n#\n\n<center>\n  \n### **描述**\n\n如果你喜欢我的其他资源包：**https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/3d-harnesses** 并且也喜欢 **Fresh Animations**，那么这个资源包非常适合你！3D Harnesses 是一个资源包……它让你的快乐鬼火鞍具变成3D的！并且支持 Fresh Animations 动画！\n\n#\n<center>\n\n### **重要提示！！！**\n同时使用这两个资源包时，请确保 **3D Harnesses** 位于 **Better Ghast** 之上。\n![在此替换为描述](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b7d5897f78f5577e4b73a09aa18b2a6a47d52fae.png)\n\n<center>\n\n#\n\n### **需求**\n  \n\n <center>\n \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cb11c74b2469d912c33123a745ff77296daee59f.webp\" width=\"80\" alt=\"EMF\"/>\n</a>\n   \n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/05b1f4c9a4777ba7fe9f9b003c1c995eeb082552_0.webp\" width=\"80\" alt=\"Fresh Animations\"/>\n</a>\n\n <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entitytexturefeatures\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2401775bd01a454f187e74d7d0c1e32b9f3c734.png\" width=\"80\" alt=\"ETF\"/>\n</a>",
